    "Clean master b24ef250e builds/links freshly with164C++receipts/178physicalobjects and has3227masked matches/1967strictPASS over5581knownmappedCPP identities. No retained editable worker. Scope101general+council identities preserves old emissions and observations; it is not permission to rewrite unrelated functions.",
    "Council already owns the two signed8-cell notification tables and make_resolution producers and council.h declares both clear_council_notify overloads. Move both intact annotation/body blocks from General to Council. Establish scenario_undo.cpp as a meaningful current module for load_undo/wipe_undo/auto_undo and ScenEditorUndoPosition only; keep unrelated auto_save/kill_auto_save and all other General members/helpers/storage unchanged. Keep public declarations in their current headers. No historic original-TU or Jackal membership claim follows from this move.",
    "Seven successful read-only native probes calibrated both complete actual General/Council objects, then compared remaining General, appended Council and default/framed undo prototypes, plus compiling ordinary wipe_undo damage. Joint101identity screen gains4243D0/5ABE40/5ABEC0/5ABF20 with zero old loss; default undo gainedonly4243D0. One earlier prototype lacked alpha.h/strings.h declarations (4success/1failedcompile), and one7success run failed only diagnostic symbol lookup; all failures/raw evidence remain cached. Prototype newowner uses an existing-host overlay and does not establish actual new-TU/build/link or strict evidence.",
    "Preserve all moved bodies, metadata, spans, symbols, historical claims and seed lessons byte-for-byte, including original signed undo-position comparisons, lack of .SAV suffix, nine-to-one iteration and rename(previous,current) bug. Do not normalize unsafe/error paths. The new owner includes actual alpha.h preference enum, strings.h shared buffer, general.h/game.h declarations and ordinary CRT. Add source once and singleton /Oy- only on scenario_undo.cpp. Council retains its existing profile; General remains default. Keep project.json/two canonical flag sets, all global/link policies, class layouts/lifetimes and prior profile controls unchanged. No new claims, fixed-address bindings, manual dispatch, volatility or retention/export forcing.",
    "Adapt Council actual-body host controls to its real owner. Add exact inverse migration controls reconstructing both immutable baseline owners from actual moved blocks/state, with negative mutation witnesses; do not substitute baseline text for altered moved code or weaken old guards. Extend existing consolidated compiler-profile test for only the new source/singleton property; preserve all prior immutable baselines and mutants. Add host semantic undo controls with original path/call/position/disabled-preference behavior and compiling damage witnesses.",
    "Before coordinator-reviewed checkpoint require fresh165receipt179object application build/link, full5581identity paired actual masked/strict observations with all4controlled gains and no old loss/classification regression, canonical101owner measurements, identity/claim/reference continuity, focused host/profile/migration tests, controlled actual-owner correspondence and explicit physical/linked residual review. Preserve pending unknown original allocation/associated-data/linked retained-selection/runtime obligations. Source homing is not full structure proof or automatic/game acceptance. Destination fresh verification precedes worker/branch/superseded build cleanup."
  ],
